[0.079, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m forward; `ShowThrust` fires each from the snapshot's thrust, an engine by the thrust ahead and a jet by\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m  how far its push and its turn about the hull's middle lie along the thrust and turn fired, its emitter\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m 's plume or puff as dense as it fires, at rest in the station's frame. Each nozzle glows at 3% at rest\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m and warms towards how hard it fires with a time constant of a second, cooling over two and a half. | Me\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m t: in the physics suite a ship at full ahead fires all of its forward thrust, shown in its snapshot; he\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m ld at 150 m/s it fires nothing; let go it brakes astern at full and turns at full about the axis asked;\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m  one no longer flown has no thrust. In the app suite a shuttle's proxy has two engines and fourteen jet\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m s; firing nothing shows nothing; half ahead a plume half as dense as full; astern the two bow jets; a s\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m trafe two jets, a climb four, a yaw three; a ship with no thrust nothing; its nozzle at 3% warms to 64.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m 2% of full in a second of firing and cools by e in two and a half. Under Xvfb the shuttle lifted off it\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m   \u001b[22m s pad by the docks fires its four downward j\u001b[56Gts, their nozzles warm, and \u001b[85Golding\u001b[92G20\u001b[95Gm/s\u001b[99Git\u001b[102Gfires\u001b[108Gnothin\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m   \u001b[22m g as th\u001b[19Gy cool. The refer\u001b[37Gnc\u001b[40G frames `docked` and `dock-sequence`\u001b[77Gare\u001b[81Gupdated\u001b[89Gfor\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97Gnozzles\u001b[105Gat\u001b[108Grest.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m   \u001b[22m |\u001b[K\