[0.151, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mNanite research\u001b[22m is in\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/tmp/claude-1000/-home-ivan-projects-jettison/01ddcc12-00f3-49e6-9929-9ac9ba26f113/scratchpad/nanite.md\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mNo fallback needed for testing:\u001b[37G\u001b[22mlavapipe,\u001b[47Gthe\u001b[51Gsoftware\u001b[60GVulkan\u001b[67Gdriver\u001b[74Gthe\u001b[78Gtests\u001b[84Grun\u001b[88Gon,\u001b[92Gdoes\u001b[97Gsupport\u001b[105Gmesh\u001b[110Gshaders.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  The tests can cover that path.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mSmallest useful first s\u001b[30Gp (3–5 days):\u001b[22m add m\u001b[50Gsh\u001b[53Gp\u001b[55Gimizer and generate LODs for\u001b[84GglTF models.\u001b[97GThis also clo\u001b[111Ges a J27\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bit\u001b[8Gm.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mClust\u001b[11Gred g\u001b[17Gometry drawn with mesh \u001b[41Ghaders:\u001b[22m about 5–8 weeks in tot\u001b[72Gl.\u001b[75GFull\u001b[80GNanite parity is\u001b[97Groughly 6–9 months.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThree conflicts to settle first:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m \u001b[5G- The scope doc lists occlusion culling as Out.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G- The anti-aliasing is MSAA, which\u001b[40Ga\u001b[42Gvisibility\u001b[53Gbuffer\u001b[60Gcan't\u001b[66Guse.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\"Clu\u001b[12Gter\"\u001b[17Galready means the lighting grid, so\u001b[53Gthe\u001b[57Ggeometry\u001b[66Gunits\u001b[72Gwould\u001b[78Gbe\u001b[81Gcalled\u001b[88Gmeshlets.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mIs it needed?\u001b[22m Manifest's content is procedural shapes and mid-poly\u001b[72GglTF,\u001b[78Gso\u001b[81GI'd\u001b[85Gonly\u001b[90Ggo\u001b[93Gbeyond\u001b[100Gthe\u001b[104Gfirst\u001b[110Gsteps\u001b[116Gonce\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bthat content shows a real\u001b[31Gcost.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mManifest\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u0