\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\"Cluster\" already\u001b[25Gmeans the l\u001b[37Gg\u001b[39Gting grid, so\u001b[53Gthe geometry\u001b[67Gnits\u001b[72Gwould\u001b[78Gbe\u001b[81Gcalled\u001b[88Gmeshlets.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mIs it needed?\u001b[22m Manifest's content is procedural shapes and mid-poly\u001b[72GglTF,\u001b[78Gso\u001b[81GI'd only go beyond\u001b[100Gthe\u001b[104Gfirst\u001b[110Gsteps\u001b[116Gonce\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gthat content shows a real cost.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mManifest\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- \u001b[1mNew layout:\u001b[17G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdocs/README.md\u001b[32G\u001b[39mis\u001b[35Gthe\u001b[39Gindex.\u001b[46GT\u001b[75Gtten\u001b[80Gagainst\u001b[88Gthe\u001b[92Gcode,\u001b[98Gplus\u001b[103Ga\u001b[105Gglossary\u001b[114Gof\u001b[117G131\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
