[0.008, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5GThe tests can cover that path.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mSmallest useful first step (3–5 days):\u001b[44G\u001b[22madd\u001b[48Gmeshoptimizer\u001b[62Gand\u001b[66Ggenerate\u001b[75GLODs\u001b[80Gfor\u001b[84GglTF\u001b[89Gmodels.\u001b[97GThis\u001b[102Galso\u001b[107Gcloses\u001b[114Ga\u001b[116GJ27\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gitem.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mClustered geometry drawn with mesh shaders:\u001b[49G\u001b[22mabout\u001b[55G5–8\u001b[59Gweeks\u001b[65Gin\u001b[68Gtotal.\u001b[75GFull\u001b[80GNanite\u001b[87Gparity\u001b[94Gis\u001b[97Groughly\u001b[105G6–9\u001b[109Gmonths.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThree conflicts to\u001b[24Gsettle first:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G- The scope doc lists occlusion culling\u001b[45Gas\u001b[48GOut.\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Banti-aliasing is MSAA, whi\u001b[38Gh a visibili\u001b[51Gy\u001b[53Gbuffer\u001b[60Gcan't\u001b[66Guse.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\"Cluster\" already\u001b[25Gmeans the l\u001b[37Gg\u001b[39Gting grid, so\u001b[53Gthe geometry\u001b[67Gnits\u001b[72Gwould\u001b[78Gbe\u001b[81Gcalled\u001b[88Gmeshlets.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mIs it needed?\u001b[22m Manifest's content is procedural shapes and mid-poly\u001b[72GglTF,\u001b[78Gso\u001b[81GI'd only go beyond\u001b[100Gthe\u001b[104Gfirst\u001b[110Gsteps\u001b[116Gonce\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gthat content shows a real cost.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mManifest\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- \u001b[1mNew layout:\u001b[17G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdocs/README.md\u001b[32G\u001b[39mis\u001b[35Gthe\u001b[39Gindex.\u001b[46GThere\u001b[52Gare\u001b[56G16\u001b[59Gfeature\u001b[67Gdocs\u001b[72Gwritten\u001b[80Gagainst\u001b[88Gthe\u001b[92Gcode,\u001b[98Gplus\u001b[103Ga\u001b[105Gglossary\u001b[114Gof\u001b[117G131\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gterms and five plans that hold open work\