o review those number once the next steps are done.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m                                                                                                                    \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mJetti\u001b[9Gon should provide an interface for\u001b[44Gdock control \u001b[58Ghat\u001b[62Gallow\u001b[68G a game to dete\u001b[84Gmine and create it's own rules for \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255madmission, refusal, rank, etc. It should be game agnostic, just supplying the core functions.\u001b[39m                         \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[39m Reading \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file…\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ cd '/home/ivan/projects/manifest' && find docs -type d\u001b[64Gempt\u001b[70G(8m 5s · 1830 lines)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
