u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mJettison should provide an interface for dock control that allows a game to determine and create it's own rules for \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Badmis\u001b[9Gion, refusal, rank, etc. It should\u001b[44Gbe game agnos\u001b[58Gic,\u001b[62Gjust \u001b[68Gupplying the co\u001b[84Ge functions.\u001b[39m                       \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mSearching\u001b[13Gfor\u001b[17G\u001b[1m2\u001b[19G\u001b[22mpatterns,\u001b[29Greading\u001b[37G\u001b[1m1\u001b[39G\u001b[22mfile,\u001b[45Grunning\u001b[53G\u001b[1m3\u001b[55G\u001b[22mshell\u001b[61Gcommands\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · 8m 42s\u001b[39m…\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ cd '/home/ivan/projects/manifest' && export CMAKE_BUILD_PARALLEL_LEVEL='24' CTEST_PARALLEL_LEVEL='24' \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mMANIFEST_TIDY_JOBS='24'; ./scripts/ci.sh --werror --asan\u001b[64G-tid\u001b[70G--log build/gate.log (8m 5s · 1830 lines)\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
