[0.112, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded\u001b[12G\u001b[1m2\u001b[22m lines,\u001b[21Gremoved \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m lin\u001b[35Gs\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 24 \u001b[11G\u001b[22m##\u001b[14GCurrent\u001b[22Gdeliveries\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 25 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 26 \u001b[22m Manifest's\u001b[22GStage\u001b[28G5\u001b[30Gclosed\u001b[37Gon\u001b[40Gthe\u001b[44Gengine's\u001b[53Gcommit\u001b[60G`13c1bec`\u001b[70G(2026-11-25).\u001b[84GManifest\u001b[93Gnow\u001b[97Gbuilds\u001b[104Gagainst\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 27 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m`459af99`, the second of two commits that provisioned the four gaps its Stage 5 cross-review found     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m 28 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m([history](history.md)). Its later work waits until the user has played its first loop for a day or    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 27 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m`70cd4de`, the docs review's head; the four gaps its Stage 5 cross-review found were provisioned       \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m28 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[48;2;4;71;0mby `459af99` and the commit before it \u001b[48;2;2;40;0m([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mhistory\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](history.md)). Its later work waits until the user has \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m   +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mplayed its first loop for a day or                                                                     \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m29 \u001b[22m two.\u001b[16GOne\u001b[20Gdelivery\u001b[29Gis\u001b[32Gopen:\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m0 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m1 \u001b[22m |\u001b[13GDelivery\u001b[22G|\u001b[24GNeeded\u001b[31Gby\u001b[34G|\u001b[36GExit\u001b[41Gcriterion\u001b[51G|\r\u001b[35C\u001b[2B\u001b[1m2\u001b[51G\u001b[22ms…\r\u001b[44C\u001b