[0.040, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(~/projects/manifest/docs/roadmap.md)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m lines, remov\u001b[27Gd \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m line\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 74 \u001b[22m Regio\u001b[17Gs gain governor-s\u001b[35Gt\u001b[37Gtax\u001b[41Grates\u001b[47G([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mL29\u001b[39m](delivery-order.md#l29)),\u001b[79Gdebt\u001b[84Gand\u001b[88Glenders\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m5\u001b[11G\u001b[22m([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mL30\u001b[39m](del\u001b[22Gvery-o\u001b[29Gde\u001b[32G.md#l30)), a power gri\u001b[55G and an AI \u001b[67Gconomy ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mL31\u001b[39m](delivery-order.md#l31)),\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m6\u001b[11G\u001b[22mand staple balances by kind of world ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mL33\u001b[39m](delivery-order.md#l33)); gold and gems move in cases\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 77 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m([L32](delivery-order.md#l32)). The design is the                                                      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 77 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mL32\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](delivery-order.md#l32)). Why the hosted prices reach about 27 times their base, and             \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m8\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mwhether the bound of 30 stays, is [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mL51\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](delivery-order.md#l51). The design\u001b[86Gis the     \u001b[98G   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[2m 79 \u001b[22m [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116meconomy plan\u001b[39m](economy-and-development-plan.md). The built rules (households and their needs,\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m80\u001b[11G\u001b[22mhealth and happiness, grains and medical supplies) are [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mthe regional economy\u001b[39m](economy.md), with\r\u