[0.118, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 78 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mwhether the bound of 30 stays, is [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mL51\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](delivery-order.md#l51). The design is the                      \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[2m9\u001b[11G\u001b[22m[\u001b[38;2;230;219;116meconomy plan\u001b[39m](e\u001b[28Gonom\u001b[33G-and-devel\u001b[44Gpment-plan.md). The built rules (households and their needs,\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 80 \u001b[22m health and happiness, grains and medical supplies) are [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mthe regional economy\u001b[39m](economy.md), with\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 81 \u001b[22m [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mtrading\u001b[39m](trading.md) and [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mprices\u001b[39m](pricing.md).\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mMade \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m scratchpad edit \u001b[38;2;56;166;96m+8\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m, committed \u001b[1m1f11aa6\u001b[22m, searched for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, read \u001b[1m61\u001b[22m files, ran \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands, recalled \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bmemory, wrote \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m memories \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mJettison's\u001b[14GJ35\u001b[18Gis\u001b[21Gcommitted\u001b[31Gas\u001b[34G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m1f11aa6\u001b[39m.\u001b[43GI'm\u001b[47Gnow\u001b[51Gwaiting\u001b[59Gfor\u001b[63Gthe\u001b[67Gagent\u001b[73Gthat\u001b[78Gupdates\u001b[86GManifest's\u001b[97Gtest\u001b[102Gexpectations.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;193;7m●\u001b[3GThis session is in Code Mode (experimental), which background sessions can't use yet, so it can't be moved or \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcopied to the background.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✶\u001b[3GSlithering… \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(34m 6s · ↓\u001b[27G31.7k 