[0.017, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m 75 \u001b[22m ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mL30\u001b[39m](delivery-order.md#l30)), a power grid and an AI economy ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mL31\u001b[39m](delivery-order.md#l31)),\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m6\u001b[11G\u001b[22mand staple balan\u001b[28Ges b\u001b[33G kind of w\u001b[44Grld ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mL33\u001b[39m](delivery-order.md#l33)); gold and gems move in cases\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 77 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m([L32](delivery-order.md#l32)). The design is the                                                      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 77 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mL32\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](delivery-order.md#l32)). Why the hosted prices reach about 27 times their base, and             \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 78 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mwhether the bound of 30 stays, is [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mL51\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](delivery-order.md#l51). The design is the                      \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m   \u001b[2m 79 \u001b[22m [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116meconomy plan\u001b[39m](economy-and-development-plan.md). The built rules (households and their needs,\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m 80 \u001b[22m health and happiness,\u001b[33Ggrains\u001b[40Gand\u001b[44Gmedical\u001b[52Gsupplies)\u001b[62Gare\u001b[66G[\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mthe regional economy\u001b[39m](economy.md),\u001b[102Gwith\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 81 \u001b[11G\u001b[22m[\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mtrading\u001b[39m](trading.md)\u001b[33Gand\u001b[37G[\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mprices\u001b[39m](pricing.md).\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mMade \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m scratchpad edit \u001b[38;2;56;166;96m+8\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m, committed \u001b[1m1f11aa6\u001b[22m, searched for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, read \u001b[1m61\u001b[22m files, ran \u001b[1m2