[0.130, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 77 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m([L32](delivery-order.md#l32)). The design is the                                                      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 77 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mL32\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](delivery-order.md#l32)). Why the hosted prices reach about 27 times their base, and             \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 78 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mwhether the bound of 30 stays, is [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mL51\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](delivery-order.md#l51). The design is the                      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[2m 79 \u001b[22m [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116meconomy plan\u001b[39m](economy-and-development-plan.md). The built rules (households and their needs,\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 80 \u001b[22m health and happiness, grains and medical supplies) are [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mthe regional economy\u001b[39m](economy.md), with\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m81\u001b[12G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mtrading\u001b[39m](trading.md) and [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mprices\u001b[39m](pricing.md).\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mMade \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m scratchpad edit \u001b[38;2;56;166;96m+8\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m, committed \u001b[1m1f11aa6\u001b[22m, searched for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, read \u001b[1m61\u001b[22m files, ran \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands, recalled \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bmemory, wrote \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m memories \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mJettison's J35 is committed\u001b[31Gas\u001b[34G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m1f11aa6\u001b[39m.\u001b[43GI'm\u001b[47Gnow\u001b[51Gwaiting\u001b[59Gfor\u001b[63Gthe\u001b[67Gagent\u001b[73Gthat\u001b[78Gupdates\u001b[86GManifest's\u001b[97Gtest\u001b[102Gexpectations.\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;193;7m●\u001b[3GThis session is in Code Mode (experimental), which background sessions can't use yet, so it can't be moved or \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;193;7mcopied to the background.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ what's taking so long?\u001b[39m                                                                                                \r\u001b[2C\u001b[5B\u001b[49m\u001b[2mPress up to edit queued messages\r\u001b[38C\u001b[3B\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent · ↓ to manage\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[21;3H\u001b[?25h"]
