[0.058, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5G- Manifest is at \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m5797559\u001b[39m, which moves its Jettison pin\u001b[60Gto \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m70cd4de\u001b[39m. It\u001b[76Gfull gate passed (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m--werror --asan --tidy\u001b[39m).\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mJettison \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m1f11aa6\u001b[39m (committed, not yet pushed):\u001b[22m adds J35, dock\u001b[66Gcontrol a game decides. It's in Tier 2, because\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BManifest's priva\u001b[22Ge ports (L04) stand on it. The engine\u001b[60Gasks\u001b[65Gthe\u001b[69Ggame's\u001b[76Grule\u001b[81Gwhen\u001b[86Ga\u001b[88Gvehicle\u001b[96Gasks\u001b[101Gfor\u001b[105Ga\u001b[107Gberth\u001b[113Gand\u001b[117Gas\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bthe\u001b[9Gqueue\u001b[15Gmoves,\u001b[22Gthen\u001b[27Gcarries\u001b[35Gout\u001b[39Gthe\u001b[43Ganswer.\u001b[51GEvery\u001b[57Grule\u001b[62Gof\u001b[65Gadmission,\u001b[76Grefusal\u001b[84Gand\u001b[88Grank\u001b[93Gstays\u001b[99Gthe\u001b[103Ggame's.\u001b[111GThe\u001b[115Gdocks'\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  open work and Manifest's planetary plan and L04 row now link to it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mManifest (uncommitted):\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m-\u001b[7G\u001b[1mTotes priced by weight:\u001b[31G\u001b[22m103\u001b[35Ggoods\u001b[41Gcarried\u001b[49Gtheir\u001b[55Gsolid\u001b[61Gdensity\u001b[69Gas\u001b[72Gunits\u001b[78Gper\u001b[82Gcubic\u001b[88Gmetre\u001b[94Gand\u001b[98Gignored\u001b[106Gthe\u001b[110Gpacking\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G    factor; they now carry the\u001b[34Gpacked figure. Copper is\u001b[59Gn\u001b[61Gw\u001b[63G7.616 t \u001b[72Go the\u001b[78Gcube instead of 8.96, and gold 496,922\u001b[117Goz\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Binstead\u001b[15Gof\u001b[18G621,152.\u001b[27GContent\u001b[35Gloading\u001b[43Gnow\u001b[47Grefuses\u001b[55Gan\u001b[58Gitem\u001b[63Gcounted\u001b[71Gby\u001b[74Gmass\u001b[79Gor\u001b[82Gvolume\u001b[89Gwhose\u001b[95Gfigure\u001b[102Gdiffers\u001b[110Gfrom\u001b[115Gt