[0.079, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mSetShadowDistance\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mNanite:\u001b[22m decide whether cluster levels of detail become a backlog item. The research was only in a scratch folder\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bthat gets cleared, so I moved it to \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdocs/nanite-research.md\u001b[39m and added it to the docs index.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mManifest\u001b[22m (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdocs/roadmap.md#waiting-on-you\u001b[39m):\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mNumbers to review:\u001b[22m the 30× price bound against prices reaching about 27× (L51), and D-108's drive numbers.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe packed-tote change:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- the fixture suites were never run on it;\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- the agent's test edits haven't been reviewed;\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- nobody knows yet why the AI now opens 6 tenders where the test expected 2.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mMerging the docs review\u001b[22m, with Jettison's.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mWhether to delete \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdata/core-config/\u001b[22m\u001b[39m, a git-ignored leftover.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe docs review's 12 unanswered questions,\u001b[48G\u001b[22mabout\u001b[54Gthe\u001b[58Glong-haul\u001b[68Gtrader,\u001b[76Gthe\u001b[80Greusable\u001b[89Goff-thread\u001b[100Gwriter,\u001b[108Gfuel\u001b[113Gpricing,\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BNPC traders,\u001b[18GD-070\u001b[24Gagainst\u001b[32GD-114,\u001b[39Gthe\u001b[43Gworld\u001b[49Gseed,\u001b[55Ggates\u001b[61Gand\u001b[65Gthe\u001b[69Ggalaxy,\u001b[77GD-105's\u001b[85Gstaple\u001b[92Gbalance,\u001b[101Gprivate\u001b[109Gvenues,\u001b[117Gthe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bbunkers' prerequ\u001b[22Gsite,\u001b[28Gtrading shortcuts and cadence.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3GThe reminde\u001b[15G I'd sav\u001b[25G \u001b[27Go\u001b[29Gmemory now lives in Manifest's roadmap,\u001b[69Gs\u001b[72GI deleted the memory.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  I left out questions already answered or booked as\u001b[54Gtasks\u001b[60G(L35–L50,\u001b[70GJ30–J35,\u001b[79GL51).\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87mCultivating…\u001b[21G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m7\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
