[1.827, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mManifest\u001b[22m (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdocs/roadmap.md#waiting-on-you\u001b[39m):\u001b[46G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mNumbers to review:\u001b[24G\u001b[22mthe 30× price\u001b[38Gb\u001b[40Gund against prices reaching about 27×\u001b[78G(L51),\u001b[85Gand D-108's\u001b[97Gdrive\u001b[103Gnumbers.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe packed-tote change:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m  - the fixture suites were never run on it;\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G- the agent's test\u001b[24Gedits haven't\u001b[39Gee\u001b[42G reviewed;\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G- nobody knows yet why the\u001b[32GAI\u001b[35Gnow\u001b[39Gopens\u001b[45G6\u001b[47Gtenders\u001b[55Gwhere\u001b[61Gthe\u001b[65Gtest\u001b[70Gexpected 2.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mMerging the docs review\u001b[22m, with Jettis\u001b[43G's.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mWhether to delete \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdata/core-config/\u001b[22m\u001b[39m, a git-ignored\u001b[56Gleftover.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe docs review's 12 unanswered questions,\u001b[22m about the long-haul \u001b[69Grader, the reusable\u001b[89Goff-thread\u001b[100Gwriter,\u001b[108Gfuel\u001b[113Gpricing,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5GNPC traders, D-070 against D-114, the world\u001b[49Gseed,\u001b[55Ggates\u001b[61Gand\u001b[65Gthe\u001b[69Ggalaxy,\u001b[77GD-105's\u001b[85Gstaple\u001b[92Gbalance,\u001b[101Gprivate\u001b[109Gvenues,\u001b[117Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gbunkers' prerequisite, trading shortcuts and cad\u001b[54Gnce.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe remin\u001b[15G I'd saved to memory now lives in\u001b[49GManifest's roa\u001b[64Gmap,\u001b[69Gso I deleted the memory.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI\u001b[5Gleft\u001b[10Gout\u001b[14Gquestions\u001b[24Galready\u001b[32Ganswered\u001b[41Gor\u001b[44Gbooked\u001b[51Gas\u001b[54Gtasks\u001b[60G(L35–L50,\u001b[70GJ30–J35,\u001b[79GL51).\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCogitated for 1m 47s · done 7:45 pm\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mHow is Claude doing this session? (optional)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m1\u001b[39m: Bad    \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m2\u001b[39m: Fine   \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m3\u001b[39m: Good   \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m0\u001b[39m: Dismiss\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
