39m,\u001b[60Gwhich\u001b[66Gyou\u001b[70Gcommitted\u001b[80Gon\u001b[83Gthe\u001b[87Gbranch\u001b[94Gyourself.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  Both repos are now checked out on \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmain\u001b[39m, and I left the \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdocs-review\u001b[39m branches\u001b[79Gin\u001b[82Gplace.\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
